    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Coderembassy wholesale pricing allows you to seamlessly add a B2B or wholesale facet to your existing WooCommerce store. You can create custom pricing rules based on user roles to offer specialized rates to different tiers of customers.</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T0McHW0JF2g?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>Features:<br />\n* Automatically creates a &#8220;Wholesale Customer&#8221; role.<br />\n* Apply fixed prices, percentage discounts, or fixed amount discounts.<br />\n* Set minimum order quantities for wholesale pricing.<br />\n* Hide retail products or prices from wholesale buyers and vice-versa.<br />\n* Catalog mode to hide prices and add-to-cart buttons for guests.<br />\n* Import pricing rules via CSV.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Ensure WooCommerce is installed and active.</li>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Navigate to WooCommerce &gt; CoderEmbassy Wholesale Pricing to configure your settings and start adding pricing rules.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20support%20product%20variations%3F\">\nDoes this support product variations?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can apply pricing rules to specific variations or globally to the parent variable product.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20import%20my%20prices%3F\">\nCan I import my prices?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, a built-in CSV importer is available to bulk-load pricing rules.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20hide%20retail%20prices%3F\">\nCan I Hide Retail prices?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, You can hide retail price.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A powerful wholesale pricing plugin for WooCommerce, allowing role-based pricing and discounts.",
    "description": "<p>Coderembassy wholesale pricing allows you to seamlessly add a B2B or wholesale facet to your existing WooCommerce store. You can create custom pricing rules based on user roles to offer specialized rates to different tiers of customers.</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T0McHW0JF2g?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>Features:<br />\n* Automatically creates a &#8220;Wholesale Customer&#8221; role.<br />\n* Apply fixed prices, percentage discounts, or fixed amount discounts.<br />\n* Set minimum order quantities for wholesale pricing.<br />\n* Hide retail products or prices from wholesale buyers and vice-versa.<br />\n* Catalog mode to hide prices and add-to-cart buttons for guests.<br />\n* Import pricing rules via CSV.</p>\n",
